; 资产。命名沿用 Beancount-Trans-Assets 的科目树。
; 起步只保留最常用的现金、工资卡、支付宝/微信；需要时按同一命名扩展。

2026-11-17 open Assets:Savings:Cash CNY
  alias: "现金"
  reconcile: "weekly"

2026-11-17 open Assets:Savings:Bank:Main CNY
  alias: "工资卡"
  reconcile: "monthly"

2026-11-17 open Assets:Savings:Web:AliPay CNY
  alias: "支付宝"

2026-11-17 open Assets:Savings:Web:AliFund CNY
  alias: "余额宝"

2026-11-17 open Assets:Savings:Web:WechatPay CNY
  alias: "微信"

2026-11-17 open Assets:Savings:Web:WechatFund CNY
  alias: "零钱通"

; 可选：多张银行卡/信用卡时，按 Assets 的命名继续加：
; 2000-01-01 open Assets:Savings:Bank:Ningbo CNY
;   alias: "宁波银行"
;   reconcile: "monthly"
